    "detailed_description": "<h1>Game Editions</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/aed90f2aae16d30e2aaab8361b809538.avif?t=1753455482\" data-has-big /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The equipment will be added to your character after every game reset.  </i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The specific types of equipment may change in future resets.  </i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Editions are upgradable, letting users upgrade by paying only the difference.</i></p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/a42438715d1fadc439c2087b7a30c1fe.poster.avif?t=1753455482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/a42438715d1fadc439c2087b7a30c1fe.webm?t=1753455482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/a42438715d1fadc439c2087b7a30c1fe.mp4?t=1753455482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winds of War puts PvP battles in the spotlight. Capture over 30 Combat Outposts, and open new spawn points along with Vulture, a newly introduced Vendor residing in some of the COPs. Streamline your experience, finish the tasks in the field, and get into action thanks to added Conflict Zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an authentic, dynamic weather that brings a fresh wind to Lamang. Battle through storms, flooded rice fields, or explore over 60 new points of interest that change with every rain drop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Additions:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat Outposts - (COP) Capture, Occupy, Protect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conflict Zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Localization - 11 New Languages</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >German</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >French</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brazilian Portuguese</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spanish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Italian</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Czech</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turkish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chinese Simplified</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Korean</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Vendor Vulture - accessible via COPs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revamped Task Flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Weapons - Beretta, SVD, SIG MCX, MP7</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mortar Strikes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved Ballistics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 60 New Locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >38 New Tasks, 18 Reworked Tasks, 33 Squad Strike Missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Improvements: Behaviour &amp; Responsiveness </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friend-Or-Foe System - Armbands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shared Kill Count in Squads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved Health System: Symptoms &amp; Health Screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaking of Interior Lights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotting Bodies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locker Sorting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth Scope Zooming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair Kits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tracking Tags</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low Settings - optimized for a smoother experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to these features, the update brings numerous quality-of-life improvements, bug fixes, and enhancements inspired by community feedback to make the experience even better.</p></p><br><h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/2b6295116f4befd998f7b31a55cd1a86.avif?t=1753455482\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*** Please note that the Roadmap is a work in progress and may be subject to change as development and community feedback evolve. ***</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only 30% of the design complete, the journey ahead is filled with potential and promise. Each new update brings us closer to refining the game with enhanced optimization, balance, and depth. As we continue to develop and expand, your feedback is crucial in shaping the future of Gray Zone Warfare. Stay with us as we build and evolve, ensuring that every step forward enhances your experience and brings new challenges to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Move Matters, <br>MADFINGER Games Team</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following a mysterious event on a fictional Southeast Asian island, the entire area has been placed under international quarantine. With most of the civilian population evacuated under the supervision of the United Nations, three PMC factions are tasked by their enigmatic clients to explore the region, uncover its secrets, and retrieve anything of value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEPLOY IN A LIVING OPEN-WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the ultimate extraction shooter set in a vast 42km\u00b2 open world of the Democratic Republic of Lamang, inspired by the stunning landscapes of Laos. As a PMC operator, embark on tactical missions to complete tasks, secure high-value loot, and survive intense FPS firefights against rival factions and AI enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/f00b5e6514b3d8eb23eb9a02a78bb3dd.poster.avif?t=1753455482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/f00b5e6514b3d8eb23eb9a02a78bb3dd.webm?t=1753455482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/f00b5e6514b3d8eb23eb9a02a78bb3dd.mp4?t=1753455482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE REALISTIC COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an immersive combat experience where precise real-world ballistics make every shot count. A unique health system simulates the human body, with injuries affecting perception and performance, forcing you to diagnose wounds and apply the right treatments to survive and support your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/a81e11b345b3bd038e0af6f21fe89ce9.poster.avif?t=1753455482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/a81e11b345b3bd038e0af6f21fe89ce9.webm?t=1753455482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/a81e11b345b3bd038e0af6f21fe89ce9.mp4?t=1753455482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNRAVEL A MATURE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a mature story experience as you uncover the mysteries of Lamang. Through numerous missions, encounter a colorful cast of morally complex characters, each hiding secrets and pursuing their own agendas. Navigate a web of lies, decide who to trust, and expose the truth in a world of shifting loyalties and gray morality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/a09817ab4bbd9996cbeaa8b9f5367a75.poster.avif?t=1753455482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/a09817ab4bbd9996cbeaa8b9f5367a75.webm?t=1753455482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/a09817ab4bbd9996cbeaa8b9f5367a75.mp4?t=1753455482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THRIVE WITH YOUR ARSENAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your ideal firearm by customizing hundreds of parts, mounts, and accessories to suit your playstyle perfectly. Adapt your tactical gear to tackle any challenge and unforeseen situations. In this high-stakes environment, every move matters, and every fight could result in losing your hard-earned gear and progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/eace8802bc408031324ed92457f6d4f1.poster.avif?t=1753455482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/eace8802bc408031324ed92457f6d4f1.webm?t=1753455482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/eace8802bc408031324ed92457f6d4f1.mp4?t=1753455482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STANDARD EDITION EQUIPMENT AT START</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/c65b53ee98952d70f142334d8e15be5f.avif?t=1753455482\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey and gear up for action with bonus equipment, a basic locker, and a lockbox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locker Size (10x25)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secure Lockbox (2x2)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10000$ (in-game)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starting Gear</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Assault Rifle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Pistol</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Knife</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Belt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Pistol Magazines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Backpack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Water</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Combat Meal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Bandage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Tourniquet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Surgery Kit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Large Blood Bag</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Splint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Painkillers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Helmet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Armor Plate Carrier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3x        Assault Rifle Magazines</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locker Contents        </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Assault Rifles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Pistols</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Stun Grenades        </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6x        Assault Rifle Magazines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4x        Pistol Magazines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Colimators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Flashlight Mounts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Flashlights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >360x        Assault Rifle Ammunition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100x        Pistol Rifle Ammunition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Helmets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Armor Plate Carriers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Backpacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Belts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Medkits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Headsets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Nightvision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Nightwision Mount</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Eyewear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Hats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Combat Meals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Water</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Splints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Surgery Kits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4x        Bandages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Tourniquets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Painkillers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Large Blood Bag</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Small Blood Bags</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The equipment will be added to your character after every game reset.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The specific types of equipment may