    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following a mysterious event on a fictional Southeast Asian island, the entire area has been placed under international quarantine. With most of the civilian population evacuated under the supervision of the United Nations, three PMC factions are tasked by their enigmatic clients to explore the region, uncover its secrets, and retrieve anything of value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEPLOY IN A LIVING OPEN-WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the ultimate extraction shooter set in a vast 42km\u00b2 open world of the Democratic Republic of Lamang, inspired by the stunning landscapes of Laos. As a PMC operator, embark on tactical missions to complete tasks, secure high-value loot, and survive intense FPS firefights against rival factions and AI enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/f00b5e6514b3d8eb23eb9a02a78bb3dd.poster.avif?t=1753455482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/f00b5e6514b3d8eb23eb9a02a78bb3dd.webm?t=1753455482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/f00b5e6514b3d8eb23eb9a02a78bb3dd.mp4?t=1753455482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE REALISTIC COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an immersive combat experience where precise real-world ballistics make every shot count. A unique health system simulates the human body, with injuries affecting perception and performance, forcing you to diagnose wounds and apply the right treatments to survive and support your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsin