ress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/eace8802bc408031324ed92457f6d4f1.poster.avif?t=1753455482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/eace8802bc408031324ed92457f6d4f1.webm?t=1753455482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/eace8802bc408031324ed92457f6d4f1.mp4?t=1753455482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STANDARD EDITION EQUIPMENT AT START</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/c65b53ee98952d70f142334d8e15be5f.avif?t=1753455482\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey and gear up for action with bonus equipment, a basic locker, and a lockbox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locker Size (10x25)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secure Lockbox (2x2)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10000$ (in-game)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starting Gear</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Assault Rifle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Pistol</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Knife</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Belt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x        Pistol Magazines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Backpack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Water</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Combat Meal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x        Bandage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb